# Native Siphon app (`mac/`)

- SwiftUI, macOS 26, bundle id `com.machiilabs.siphon`; `mac/project.yml` (XcodeGen) is the source of truth. The `.xcodeproj` and `Info.plist` are generated and gitignored.
- Build and install as described in `app-install.mdc`. `--integration` also runs `IntegrationTests` (a real yt-dlp download of the iStock sample into `/tmp`); run it after engine changes.
- The app reads the repo's `sites/` folder (copied into the bundle at build time), so site entries work in both versions.
- Views get `DownloadQueue` as an explicit parameter, not through the environment (same rule as Skagway).
- Don't drive the GUI; hand the user repro steps instead.
